There's a lot in the bar, there's a lot in the apartment, and it feels like there's a ton going on, but sets-wise, it was actually kind of great because most of it takes place there.
酒吧有很多，公寓里也有很多，感觉有很多事情在发生，但从布景来看，其实挺棒的，因为大部分都发生在那里。

